e city. The present tenants are EnziMedia, Revstart Co-work, Norvic Shipping and Omnipresent Robot Technologies.\n\n## Tenants\n\nlock\n\nTo Unlock the view, Please sign up)  with your business details\n\n### \n\n### \n\n### \n\n### [...] Cityinfo's Property Portal, rated as one the top\ncommercial property portals in India  is\ndesigned to help corporate occupiers find their ideal real estate options across\nIndia.\nDeveloped by Cityinfo services, one of the best real estate companies in Bangalore, it\npresents users with an extensive listing of office spaces including dedicated office\nspaces\nand\nemerging concepts such as co-working & managed offices, extend across key Tier 1\n& 2\nIndian\nmarkets. Thoughtfully designed with an intuitive navigation, the portal offers a\nquick view\nof\nvarious options available through an easy-to-use search functionality. Once users\nhave\nshortlisted their preferred option/s, our team of realty experts at Cityinfo can\nhelp close\nthe\ntransactions in a smooth manner.","score":0.77096564,"raw_content":null,"id":"f376ca-02"},{"url":"https://propliners.in/eco-tower-noida-sector-125","title":"Eco Tower Noida Sector 125 | 9899920199 - Propliners Realty","content":"Amenities: Impressive 2,000 sq ft double-height lobby. Three high-speed Schindler elevators and a separate service elevator. Ample parking for over 90 cars","score":0.74563974,"raw_content":null,"id":"f23ae3-03"},{"url":"https://www.facebook.com/panoramagrouppurnea/posts/eco-tower-purnea-ka-naya-landmarka-home-where-comfort-meets-class-eco-tower-purn/1438229974974704","title":"Eco Tower – Purnea ka naya landmark! A home where ...","content":"... amenities like a balcony garden, swimming pool with an infinity edge, eco-pond & more apart from your regular fitness and entertainment","score":0.72465646,"raw_content":null,"id":"dec57f-04"},{"url":"https://www.magicbricks.com/eco-tower-amenities-goregaon-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235303239343630","title":"ECO Tower Amenities & Facilities, Goregaon West, Mumbai","content":"Project Thumbnail\n\n# ECO Tower Amenities Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\n## Amenities\n\n|  |  |\n --- |\n| ECO Tower Price | Rs. 2.50 Cr - 3.50 Cr |\n| ECO Tower Status | Ready To Move |\n| ECO Tower Possession Date | 01 January 2009 |\n| Towers in ECO Tower | 1 |\n\n### How is the Goregaon West Real Estate Market?","score":0.6760432,"raw_content":null,"id":"0994ff-05"},{"url":"https://www.addressofchoice.com/eco-tower-goregaon-west-mumbai-p42042","title":"Eco Tower Goregaon West Mumbai - Reviews, Price, ...","content":"Convenience Amenities ; Lifts ; Car Parking ; Power Back-up ; Water Storage ; Waste Disposal","score":0.6742441,"raw_content":null,"id":"36d043-06"},{"url":"https://www.hsnrealty.com/listing/eco-towers","title":"Eco Towers | Sector-125, Noida | Grade A Office Space For Rent","content":"What sets Eco Tower apart is not just its infrastructure but its values – a corporate statement reflecting a deep commitment to environmental responsibility. The building features a 2,000 sqft double-height lobby, ample parking for over 90 cars, and easy access facilitated by three high-speed elevators. The floor plates boast high efficiency with 15-meter column-free spans, a separate service elevator, and dedicated refuge areas.\n\nA professionally managed business center within Eco Tower offers plug-and-play facilities, multiple conference rooms, and a boardroom. Serving as an incubation hub, it caters to firms looking to establish offices. The building ensures 100% redundancy with full power backup and fiber connectivity from multiple providers. [...] Eco Tower, a leading Grade A office building just 2km from the Delhi border in Sector 125, NOIDA, embodies a strong commitment to green and environmentally friendly sustainable design. Going beyond philosophy, it passionately embraces environmental responsibility, offering world-class facilities tailored to meet the contemporary needs of global companies. With a 2,000 sqft double-height lobby, ample parking, and high-efficiency floor plates, Eco Tower stands out for its values and infrastructure. The building features a professionally managed business center providing plug-and-play facilities and incubation services. Ensuring 100% redundancy with full power backup and fiber connectivity, Eco Tower's rooftop offers recreation facilities, creating a holistic and sustainable workspace for [...] creating a holistic and sustainable workspace for forward-thinking companies. Experience premier office spaces integrating eco-friendly principles and cutting-edge amenities at Eco Tower in NOIDA's Sector 125.","score":0.6636041,"raw_content":null,"id":"e22716-07"}],"response_time":4.05,"request_id":"f2b38bc1-76bc-4aee-9e2a-c9b07004dc41"}